# w.request/shards/keys: the reader keys per tab (what a constraint attribute= may name). Generated once from the
# PSys2 reader inventory (official-dataset/inventory.json, 2026-11-24); from now on this shard is the source and the
# inventory follows it (psys2 official-dataset/keys_from_sop.py). Add or change a key here, argued (Q-schema).
